  "name": "Jamba Juice Receipt",
  "description": "This receipt is issued by Jamba Juice and identifies the location as Jamba Juice Central Park. The header contains the store branding, location name, contact telephone number, customer identifier, bill number, cashier identification (Yuli), and transaction time. The financial section records the total quantity purchased, gross amount, net amount, 10.0% tax, final transaction total, cash payment received, and change returned. The footer contains the corporate information for PT Sari Coffee Indonesia, including the NPWP tax registration number and registered business address in Jakarta Pusat, followed by a customer appreciation message and transaction barcode number. The overall layout is representative of an Indonesian beverage retail POS receipt, combining tax reporting, cash-payment reconciliation, corporate identification, and transaction controls within a compact retail receipt format.",
